"\t\t\t<li>active (we want to connect to the other party)</li>\n"
"\t\t\t<li>passive (we want to accept connections only)</li>\n"
"\t\t\t<li>actpass (we will do both)</li>\n"
"\t\t\t</ul>"
msgstr ""
"我們是否願意接受連線、連線至對方，或兩者皆是。\n"
"\t\t此值將用於提供時的傳出 SDP，以及當遠端傳送 actpass 時用於傳入 SDP 提供\n"
"\t\t<ul>\n"
"\t\t\t<li>active（我們想要連線至對方）</li>\n"
"\t\t\t<li>passive（我們只想要接受連線）</li>\n"
"\t\t\t<li>actpass（我們會執行以上兩者）</li>\n"
"\t\t\t</ul>"

